const pages=[['overview','grid','Overview'],['invoices','invoice','Invoices'],['quotes','invoice','Quotes'],['collections','clock','Collections'],['expenses','expense','Expenses'],['customers','users','Customers'],['items','box','Items'],['reports','chart','Reports'],['cashflow','chart','Cash Flow']];
function render(){const current=route.quote||route.page==='quote'?'quotes':route.page==='editor'||route.page==='invoice'?'invoices':route.page;const navCurrent=current==='client'?'customers':current;document.title=`${current[0].toUpperCase()+current.slice(1)} · InvoiceFlow`;app.innerHTML=`<div class="shell"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><img src="icon.svg" alt="">InvoiceFlow</div><div class="nav-label">Your workspace</div><nav aria-label="Main navigation">${pages.map(([p,i,label])=>`<button class="nav-item ${p===navCurrent?'active':''}" data-page="${p}" ${p===navCurrent?'aria-current="page"':''}>${icon(i)}<span>${label}</span></button>`).join('')}<button class="nav-item ${navCurrent==='settings'?'active':''}" data-page="settings" ${navCurrent==='settings'?'aria-current="page"':''}>${icon('settings')}<span>Settings</span></button></nav><div class="side-bottom"><div class="local-status"><div><span class="dot"></span>Saved on this device</div><div>No account. No data uploads.</div><button class="link-button small" data-action="businesses">Switch business</button></div><button class="nav-item" data-action="demo">${icon(mode==='demo'?'arrow':'box')}<span>${mode==='demo'?'Exit demo workspace':'Explore with sample data'}</span></button></div></aside><div class="workspace"><header class="topbar"><div class="crumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <strong>${esc(pages.find(p=>p[0]===current)?.[2]||(current==='client'?'Customers':'Settings'))}</strong></div><div class="mobile-brand"><img src="icon.svg" alt="">InvoiceFlow</div><div class="top-right"><span class="tag">${mode==='demo'?'DEMO WORKSPACE':'LOCAL FIRST · ZAR'}</span><button class="icon-btn" data-action="theme" aria-label="Toggle light or dark mode">${icon(document.documentElement.dataset.theme==='dark'?'sun':'moon')}</button><button class="avatar" data-page="settings" aria-label="Business settings">${esc((state.business.name||'You').split(' ').map(w=>w[0]).slice(0,2).join('').toUpperCase())}</button></div></header><main class="content" id="main" tabindex="-1">${mode==='demo'?`<div class="banner demo-banner"><span><strong>Demo workspace.</strong> These are example records. Your real data is separate.</span><button class="btn small" data-action="demo">Exit demo ${icon('arrow')}</button></div>`:''}${renderPage()}<footer class="footer"><span>InvoiceFlow <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> A little less admin.</span><span><span id="offline-footer">${offlineReady?'Offline ready · ':''}</span>Device only. Back up regularly. <button class="link-button small" data-action="backup">Export backup ${icon('up')}</button></span></footer></main></div></div>`;maybeBackupNudge();bindPage();enhanceScrollRegions();renderedOnce=true;}
function enhanceScrollRegions(){const nav=app.querySelector('nav'),active=nav?.querySelector('[aria-current=page]');if(nav&&active&&nav.scrollWidth>nav.clientWidth)nav.scrollLeft=active.offsetLeft-nav.offsetLeft-(nav.clientWidth-active.offsetWidth)/2;for(const table of app.querySelectorAll('.table-wrap')){if(table.scrollWidth<=table.clientWidth)continue;table.tabIndex=0;table.setAttribute('role','region');table.setAttribute('aria-label','Scrollable table. Use arrow keys or swipe sideways to see all columns.');const hint=document.createElement('p');hint.className='table-scroll-hint';hint.textContent='Swipe or scroll sideways to see all columns →';table.before(hint)}}
function heading(title,subtitle,actions='',eyebrow='YOUR MONEY, AT A GLANCE'){return `<div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">${eyebrow}</div><h1>${title}</h1><p class="subtitle">${subtitle}</p></div><div class="actions">${actions}</div></div>`}
